{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"51a928b5-efa1-4fa4-ae3e-6ec28761d74f","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have the full context for Q4.4. Let me summarize:\n\n**Q4.4**: 针对 MoE（expert FFN 的 GEMM tile + routing 计算）、DiT（attention tile + MLP/convolution tile + timestep embedding）、多模态（cross-attention tile + modality fusion tile）、Video（spatial attention tile + temporal attention tile + 3D conv tile + optical flow tile），tile size/shape 如何根据硬件体系结构优化以最大化多算子/微算子并发？\n\n具体分析：\n(1) GPU 上——tile size 与 SM 资源匹配，tile 形状如何影响 Tensor Core MMA tile 利用率\n(2) NPU 脉动阵列——tile 尺寸如何匹配 Cube Unit 和 Vector Unit\n(3) TPU——tile 必须适配 MXU systolic array\n(4) tile 切分与多算子并发的交互——persistent kernel 中如何同时管理多个不同形状的 tile\n(5) 动态 tile 切分——运行时调整 tile size\n\n预关键词: tile size优化, tile size optimization, tile shape适配, tile shape adaptation, MMA tile, 16x16x16 tile, Tensor Core tile, SM resource allocation, register allocation per tile, shared memory per tile, warp occupancy per tile, persistent kernel multi-tile, 多tile并发管理, MoE GEMM tile, expert FFN tiling, DiT attention tile, spatial attention tile, temporal attention tile, 3D convolution tile, cross-attention tile, modality fusion tile, NPU Cube Unit, 昇腾Cube矩阵乘约束, MXU systolic array 128x128, TPU tile适配, Groq TSP tile mapping, 动态tile切分, dynamic tile partitioning, runtime tile adjustment, CUTLASS tile configuration, Triton autotuning, tile-level load balancing\n\nNow I need to:\n1. Perform semantic segmentation of Q4.4 into logical chain nodes (S1, S2, S3...)\n2. Search the four vault directories with long-to-short query ladder for each node\n3. Read the top 15-20 deduplicated notes\n4. Write the answer at L4 kernel scheduling granularity\n\nLet me set up the semantic segmentation first and then execute the searches.\n\n## Semantic Segmentation\n\nLet me break Q4.4 into logical chain nodes:\n\n**S1**: MoE expert FFN GEMM tile + routing 计算 → 对象/模型负载\n- 原文: \"MoE（expert FFN 的 GEMM tile + routing 计算）\"\n- 核心概念: MoE, expert FFN, GEMM tile, routing, token dispatch\n- 长匹配: `\"expert FFN\" \"GEMM tile\" MoE routing`\n- 降级: `\"expert FFN\" tiling`, `MoE GEMM kernel`, `expert parallelism tiling`\n\n**S2**: DiT attention tile + MLP/convolution tile + timestep embedding → 对象/模型负载\n- 原文: \"DiT（attention tile + MLP/convolution tile + timestep embedding）\"\n- 核心概念: DiT, diffusion transformer, attention tile, MLP tile, convolution tile, timestep embedding\n- 长匹配: `DiT attention tile MLP \"diffusion transformer\" tiling`\n- 降级: `DiT kernel tiling`, `diffusion attention tile`, `DiT convolution kernel`\n\n**S3**: 多模态 cross-attention tile + modality fusion tile → 对象/模型负载\n- 原文: \"多模态（cross-attention tile + modality fusion tile）\"\n- 核心概念: cross-attention, multimodal, modality fusion, vision-language tile\n- 长匹配: `multimodal \"cross-attention\" tile \"modality fusion\"`\n- 降级: `cross-attention tiling`, `multimodal fusion kernel`, `vision language attention tile`\n\n**S4**: Video spatial attention tile + temporal attention tile + 3D conv tile + optical flow tile → 对象/模型负载\n- 原文: \"Video（spatial attention tile + temporal attention tile + 3D conv tile + optical flow tile）\"\n- 核心概念: video, spatial attention, temporal attention, 3D convolution, optical flow, video transformer\n- 长匹配: `video \"spatial attention\" \"temporal attention\" \"3D convolution\" tile`\n- 降级: `video transformer tiling`, `spatial temporal attention kernel`, `3D conv kernel tile`\n\n**S5**: GPU tile size 与 SM 资源（register, shared memory, warp slots）匹配 + Tensor Core MMA tile 利用率 → 核心机制/GPU 优化\n- 原文: \"tile size 与 SM 资源（register、shared memory、warp slots）的匹配，tile 形状如何影响 Tensor Core 的 MMA tile（16×16×16 for FP16、32×16×16 for INT8）利用率\"\n- 核心概念: SM resource, register file, shared memory, warp slots, Tensor Core, MMA tile, 16x16x16, occupancy\n- 长匹配: `\"Tensor Core\" \"MMA tile\" \"SM resource\" occupancy register \"shared memory\"`\n- 降级: `\"MMA tile\" 16x16x16 FP16`, `Tensor Core tile shape`, `SM occupancy tiling`, `register allocation tile`\n\n**S6**: NPU 脉动阵列 tile 匹配 Cube Unit + Vector Unit → 核心机制/NPU 优化\n- 原文: \"tile 尺寸如何匹配 Cube Unit 的矩阵乘尺寸约束和 Vector Unit 的向量化宽度\"\n- 核心概念: NPU, Cube Unit, Vector Unit, 达芬奇架构, 昇腾, systolic array\n- 长匹配: `NPU \"Cube Unit\" \"Vector Unit\" tile size systolic`\n- 降级: `昇腾 tiling`, `Ascend Cube matrix multiply`, `NPU tile constraint`, `达芬奇 tile size`\n\n**S7**: TPU MXU systolic array 128x128/128x256 → 核心机制/TPU 优化\n- 原文: \"tile 必须适配 128×128 或 128×256 的 MXU systolic array\"\n- 核心概念: TPU, MXU, systolic array, 128x128, 128x256, TPU tile\n- 长匹配: `TPU \"MXU systolic array\" \"128x128\" tile`\n- 降级: `TPU tiling MXU`, `systolic array tile shape`, `TPU kernel tile constraint`\n\n**S8**: persistent kernel 中同时管理多个不同形状 tile → 多算子并发交互\n- 原文: \"在 persistent kernel 中如何同时管理多个不同形状的 tile（如 attention 的 Q tile + K tile + V tile 分别需要不同的 shared memory 分配）以实现微算子级并发\"\n- 核心概念: persistent kernel, multi-tile management, QKV tiles, shared memory allocation, micro-operator concurrency\n- 长匹配: `\"persistent kernel\" \"multi tile\" \"attention\" Q K V \"shared memory\"`\n- 降级: `persistent kernel tile management`, `multi-tile concurrent kernel`, `QKV tile shared memory`, `micro-operator tile concurrent`\n\n**S9**: 动态 tile 切分——运行时调整 → 动态优化\n- 原文: \"是否可能根据输入形状（如 MoE 的不同 expert 输入 token 数、DiT 不同 diffusion step 的 latent size）在运行时调整 tile size\"\n- 核心概念: dynamic tile, runtime tile adjustment, input-dependent tiling, MoE token dispatch, DiT diffusion step\n- 长匹配: `\"dynamic tile\" runtime adjustment \"input shape\" expert token diffusion step`\n- 降级: `dynamic tiling runtime`, `adaptive tile size`, `input-dependent tiling`, `Triton autotuning tile`\n\nNow let me execute the searches. I'll start with Level A (长匹配) for all nodes across all four directories. Since there are 9 nodes × 4 directories, that's potentially 36 omnisearch calls for Level A alone. Let me be strategic and batch the most promising ones first.\n\nActually, let me organize this more efficiently. I'll search in parallel for all nodes at Level A, then see which need downgrading.\n\nLet me start with the most important nodes first.","signature":"51a928b5-efa1-4fa4-ae3e-6ec28761d74f"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":23746,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":28032,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"07e62424-a8e4-4a30-94c9-4ad8139afb00","uuid":"7f1256e1-fb8f-4123-9c01-874f6e6e629e"}
