 运行时调整 | 动态优化 | dynamic tile, runtime, input shape, MoE token, diffusion step | `\"dynamic tile\" runtime adaptation \"tile size\" MoE DiT` |\n\nNow executing Level A searches across all four directories for the most critical nodes first:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":23746,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":28032,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"07e62424-a8e4-4a30-94c9-4ad8139afb00","uuid":"5897a666-d050-4ed2-976d-0569012ed764"}
