DAG流水线。核心理念：利用LLM computation graph的确定性拓扑顺序（parameters按layer顺序访问），将参数restoration操作（CMA allocation、flash I/O、AES decryption）与CPU/NPU computation重叠执行，把restoration latency隐藏到computation latency下。配合priority-based greedy scheduling、preemptive micro-operator scheduling和partial parameter caching，使…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Tile-Based Zero-Tuning Compilation.md\",\"basename\":\"Tile-Based Zero-Tuning Compilation\",\"score\":59.89459809753512,\"foundWords\":[\"micro\",\"operator\",\"operator切分为tile/micro\",\"operator切分为tile\",\"operators，为每个tile生成多种ilp/tlp/arithmetic\",\"operators\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"operator切分为tile/micro\",\"offset\":124},{\"match\":\"operators，为每个tile生成多种ILP/TLP/arithmetic\",\"offset\":146},{\"match\":\"micro\",\"offset\":208},{\"match\":\"operator\",\"offset\":658},{\"match\":\"micro\",\"offset\":669},{\"match\":\"operators\",\"offset\":675},{\"match\":\"operators\",\"offset\":705},{\"match\":\"operator\",\"offset\":726}],\"excerpt\":\"Tile-Based Zero-Tuning Compilation是Infera compiler的核心编译策略：将DNN operator切分为tile/micro operators，为每个tile生成多种ILP/TLP/arithmetic intensity trade-off配置的micro-kernel candidates，编译过程完全基于静态分析（资源约束、instruction scheduling、warp specialization），无需GPU profiling或性能模型评估（zero-tuning）。相比Ansor/MetaSchedule的搜索式编译（2-3个数量级的编译时间差异），zero-tuning通过固定数值化配置直接生成高质量kernel。\\n从编译框架角度拆解术语，比如术…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/PIT (Permutation Invariant Transformation) for MoE.md\",\"basename\":\"PIT (Permutation Invariant Transformation) for MoE\",\"score\":47.177815480755655,\"foundWords\":[\"micro\",\"micro_tiles\",\"micro-tiles\",\"operator\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"e micro-til\",\"offset\":252},{\"match\":\"e\\nmicro_til\",\"offset\":297},{\"match\":\"e(micro_til\",\"offset\":388},{\"match\":\"明 operat\",\"offset\":593}],\"excerpt\":\"# PIT Tiling: sparse micro-tiles -> dense tile -> GEMM -> inverse\\nmicro_tiles = extract_per_expert_tiles(input_tokens, tile_size)\\ndense_tile = pit_rearrange(micro_tiles)    