{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_00_5PmU0VHtTQadDVuzijA52294","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":{\"mode\":\"omnisearch\",\"hits\":[{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Tiling in GPU Attention Kernel.md\",\"basename\":\"Tiling in GPU Attention Kernel\",\"score\":6335.817960673636,\"foundWords\":[\"tiling\",\"tiling（分块/tile化）在gpu\",\"tiling的block\",\"tiling的通用实现方式：\",\"tiling的通用实现方式\",\"tiling参数:\",\"tiling参数\",\"tile\",\"tile化\",\"tile:\",\"gpu\",\"kernel\",\"kernel知识笔记\",\"kernel设计中指将大型矩阵/张量计算分解为较小tile（通常fit在on-chip\",\"kernel设计中指将大型矩阵\",\"kernel中使用`__shared__`\",\"kernel中使用\",\"cuda\",\"occupancy\",\"occupancy——更大的block占用更多sram\",\"occupancy）。flashattention的block\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Tiling\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":13},{\"match\":\"Kernel\",\"offset\":27},{\"match\":\"Tiling（分块/tile化）在GPU\",\"offset\":80},{\"match\":\"kernel设计中指将大型矩阵/张量计算分解为较小tile（通常fit在on-chip\",\"offset\":101},{\"match\":\"tile\",\"offset\":171},{\"match\":\"tile\",\"offset\":210},{\"match\":\"tiling\",\"offset\":230},{\"match\":\"occupancy）。FlashAttention的block\",\"offset\":443},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":718},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":739},{\"match\":\"tiling\",\"offset\":798},{\"match\":\"tile:\",\"offset\":909},{\"match\":\"tile:\",\"offset\":967},{\"match\":\"tile:\",\"offset\":1025},{\"match\":\"Tiling参数:\",\"offset\":1184},{\"match\":\"Tiling的通用实现方式：\",\"offset\":1878},{\"match\":\"CUDA\",\"offset\":1896},{\"match\":\"kernel中使用`__shared__`\",\"offset\":1901},{\"match\":\"tile\",\"offset\":1931},{\"match\":\"tile\",\"offset\":1964},{\"match\":\"tiling\",\"offset\":2015},{\"match\":\"tiling\",\"offset\":2031},{\"match\":\"tiling的block\",\"offset\":2095},{\"match\":\"tile\",\"offset\":2166},{\"match\":\"occupancy——更大的block占用更多SRAM\",\"offset\":2187},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":2331}],\"excerpt\":\"## Tiling in GPU Attention Kernel\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nTiling（分块/tile化）在GPU kernel设计中指将大型矩阵/张量计算分解为较小tile（通常fit在on-chip SRAM/shared memory中）的技术。每个tile从HBM加载到SRAM，在SRAM中计算，累加中间结果，然后移到下一个tile。FlashAttention将tiling应用于attention计算——Q/K/V沿sequence length维度分块，双loop结构（outer: KV blocks加…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Hardware-Aligned Tile Search (WELDER).md\",\"basename\":\"Hardware-Aligned Tile Search (WELDER)\",\"score\":2522.052202340585,\"foundWords\":[\"tiling中\",\"tile\",\"tile_config,\",\"tile_size\",\"tile,\",\"tile-graph\",\"tiles\",\"gpu\",\"gpu:\",\"kernel知识笔记\",\"cuda\",\"occupancy\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Tile\",\"offset\":20},{\"match\":\"Tile\",\"offset\":66},{\"match\":\"tile\",\"offset\":87},{\"match\":\"Tiling中\",\"offset\":124},{\"match\":\"tiles\",\"offset\":144},{\"match\":\"tile\",\"offset\":160},{\"match\":\"tile\",\"offset\":180},{\"match\":\"tile\",\"offset\":314},{\"match\":\"tile\",\"offset\":427},{\"match\":\"tile\",\"offset\":455},{\"match\":\"tiles\",\"offset\":616},{\"match\":\"tiles\",\"offset\":664},{\"match\":\"tile\",\"offset\":702},{\"match\":\"tile\",\"offset\":722},{\"match\":\"tile\",\"offset\":797},{\"match\":\"tile\",\"offset\":809},{\"match\":\"tile\",\"offset\":831},{\"match\":\"tile\",\"offset\":877},{\"match\":\"tile\",\"offset\":893},{\"match\":\"tile\",\"offset\":939},{\"match\":\"CUDA\",\"offset\":1012},{\"match\":\"GPU:\",\"offset\":1017},{\"match\":\"tile,\",\"offset\":1088},{\"match\":\"tile\",\"offset\":1172},{\"match\":\"tiles\",\"offset\":1319},{\"match\":\"tile_size\",\"offset\":1344},{\"match\":\"tiles\",\"offset\":1376},{\"match\":\"tiles\",\"offset\":1468},{\"match\":\"tile\",\"offset\":1559},{\"match\":\"tile_config,\",\"offset\":1746},{\"match\":\"tile\",\"offset\":1936},{\"match\":\"occupancy\",\"offset\":2148},{\"match\":\"Tiling中\",\"offset\":2278},{\"match\":\"tile\",\"offset\":2333},{\"match\":\"Tile-graph\",\"offset\":2524}],\"excerpt\":\"## Hardware-Aligned Tile Search (WELDER)\\n术语是什么？\\nHardware-Aligned Tile Search是WELDER在枚举tile shape时施加硬件约束的penalty机制。在SubGraphTiling中，EnumerateSubtiles从size=1开始扩展tile shape（类似Roller的tile shape expanding approach），但WELDER在MemTraffic cost model基础上附加三个hardware-aware penalty：(1) **Uncoalesced Memory Access Penalty**——若tile s…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/FlashAttention（IO-Aware精确注意力融合Kernel）.md\",\"basename\":\"FlashAttention（IO-Aware精确注意力融合Kernel）\",\"score\":611.0395704384591,\"foundWords\":[\"tiling\",\"tile\",\"tiled\",\"gpu\",\"kernel\",\"kernel知识笔记\",\"kernel，通过\",\"cuda\",\"occupancy\",\"occupancy（更少的\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Kernel\",\"offset\":33},{\"match\":\"CUDA\",\"offset\":148},{\"match\":\"kernel，通过\",\"offset\":153},{\"match\":\"tiling\",\"offset\":163},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":234},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":277},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":534},{\"match\":\"kernel\",\"offset\":555},{\"match\":\"Tiled\",\"offset\":630},{\"match\":\"tile\",\"offset\":709},{\"match\":\"tiling\",\"offset\":2012},{\"match\":\"occupancy（更少的\",\"offset\":2134},{\"match\":\"GPU\",\"offset\":2713}],\"excerpt\":\"## FlashAttention（IO-Aware精确注意力融合Kernel）\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nFlashAttention 是 Dao et al.（2022, NeurIPS）提出的 IO-aware 精确注意力 CUDA kernel，通过 tiling 和 recomputation 技术避免将完整的 $N \\\\times N$ 注意力中间矩阵（softmax 的输入和输出）写入 GPU HBM，将 HBM 访问量从 $O(N^2)$ 降至 $O(N)$。核心洞察：GPU 的 SRAM 带宽（~20TB/s on A100）远高于 HBM 带宽（~2TB/s），attenti…\"}],\"totalCount\":3,\"truncated\":false},\"effectiveQuery\":\"path:knowledge_notes tiling tile GPU kernel CUDA occupancy\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"07e62424-a8e4-4a30-94c9-4ad8139afb00","uuid":"7dc98743-0901-4557-85ef-d64fb1f3b453","timestamp":"2026-05-31T09:59:34.549Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"result\":{\"mode\":\"omnisearch\",\"hits\":[{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Tiling in GPU Attention Kernel.md\",\"basename\":\"Tiling in GPU Attention Kernel\",\"score\":6335.817960673636,\"foundWords\":[\"tiling\",\"tiling（分块/tile化）在gpu\",\"tiling的block\",\"tiling的通用实现方式：\",\"tiling的通用实现方式\",\