{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"ca594608-b008-439b-b640-c12add644cfc","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"call_00_iJyin306hpXODMFRidyp6087","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/data3/paper_analysis/learning_outputs/20260529_185938__MoEDiT多模态Video__单GPUNPU加速器__多算子微算子并发__硬件体系结构/Q4.4_L4_answer.md","content":"# Q4.4 — Tile Size/Shape 如何根据硬件体系结构优化以最大化多算子/微算子并发\n\n## 笔记证据概览\n\n| 路径 | 分数 | 关键信息 |\n|------|------|----------|\n| `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Tiling in GPU Attention Kernel.md` | 6335.8 | FlashAttention tile策略、SRAM分配、block size公式、HBM访问量分析 |\n| `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/GPU Memory Hierarchy (HBM vs SRAM).md` | 3119.0 | GPU存储层次数据流、HBM→L2→SMEM→RF完整路径、带宽层级 |\n| `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Hardware-Aligned Tile Search (WELDER).md` | 2522.1 | 硬件对齐的tile shape搜索、coalesced/parallelism/capacity三惩罚 |\n| `paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/FlashMoE.../1-Introduction.md` | 2752.3 | MoE persistent kernel、tile(128,64)、processor/scheduler/subscriber actor模型 |\n| `paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/KernelEvolve...` | 5991.2 | 异构加速器kernel编码、tile-based编程模型、自动kernel生成 |\n| `paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/ThunderKittens.../span-idpage-14-0spanB-EXTENDED-RESULTS.md` | 1713.1 | H100/4090/M2跨平台kernel、16×16默认tile、producer-consumer流水线 |\n| `paper_secs/secs_2026/14-PAT...` | 2847.2 | 多tile kernel资源高效调度、prefix-aware attention |\n| `paper_secs/secs_2026/29-Difflow.../4-Compile-Time-Optimizations.md` | 1680.2 | DiT/diffusion模型dGraph分解、tile-based编译、ragged operation regularization |\n| `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/FlashAttention（IO-Aware精确注意力融合Kernel）.md` | 611.0 | online softmax rescaling、HBM→SRAM IO优化、FlashAttention-2/3演进 |\n| `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/PIT (Permutation Invariant Transformation) for MoE.md` | 47.2 | MoE稀疏micro-tile→dense tile重组、置换不变性保证等价 |\n| `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Tile-Based Zero-Tuning Compilation.md` | 59.9 | Infera compiler tile/micro-operator切分、ILP/TLP/arithmetic intensity配置 |\n| `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Multi-Version Micro Kernel Generation.md` | 414.7 | 同一micro operator多版本kernel生成、register/smem/pipeline stage组合 |\n| `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Ragged Batching Kernels via Round-Robin...` | 19.6 | 基于regular operator tiling plan的ragged kernel、round-robin tile→thread block映射 |\n\n---\n\n## 检索上下文映射\n\n### S1: MoE expert FFN GEMM tile + routing 计算（对象/模型负载）\n- `paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/FlashMoE.../1-Introduction.md` (score: 2752.3, query: `\"expert FFN\" \"GEMM tile\" MoE routing kernel`): FlashMoE 单 persistent kernel 融合全部 MoE 算子，tile dimensions (128,64)，processor/scheduler/subscriber actor 模型，CUTLASS 底层 GEMM，93.17% SM 利用率\n- `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/PIT (Permutation Invariant Transformation) for MoE.md` (score: 47.2, query: `\"expert FFN\" \"GEMM tile\" MoE routing`): PIT 将稀疏 micro-tile 重组为 GPU 高效 dense tile\n\n### S2: DiT attention tile + MLP/convolution + timestep embedding（对象/模型负载）\n- `paper_secs/secs_2026/29-Difflow.../4-Compile-Time-Optimizations.md` (score: 1680.2, query: `DiT diffusion transformer attention kernel tiling`): DiT 模型 QKV/MHSA/MLP 的 dGraph 分解、tile-based 编译、ragged operation regularization\n- `paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/Memory-Efficient Acceleration of Block Low-Rank...` (score: 1742.0, query: same): DiT-XL/2 kernel memory optimization, diffusion transformer kernel\n\n### S3: 多模态 cross-attention tile + modality fusion tile（对象/模型负载）\n- `paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/Flex Attention.../3-FRONT-END-DESIGN-AND-IMPLEMENTATION.md` (score: 1673.5, query: `FlashAttention tile QKV shared memory`): 统一注意力的 abstraction、多种 attention variant kernel\n- 该链条节点专属多模态 kernel tiling 笔记证据较少——notes 缺乏多模态 fusion kernel 具体的 tile shape 讨论\n\n### S4: Video spatial-temporal attention + 3D conv + optical flow（对象/模型负载）\n- `paper_secs/secs_2026/29-Difflow.../4-Compile-Time-Optimizations.md` (score: 1680.2, query: same as S2): Difflow 覆盖 video diffusion (SVD)、temporal/spatial attention 的 tile 级优化\n- 该链条节点笔记证据不足——vault 中缺少 video-specific 3D conv kernel tiling 和 optical flow tile 的详细资料\n\n### S5: GPU tile size 与 SM 资源匹配 + Tensor Core MMA tile 利用率（核心机制/GPU）\n- `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Tiling in GPU Attention Kernel.md` (score: 6335.8): FlashAttention block size 公式 $B_c = \\lceil M/4d \\rceil$，SRAM 分配 155KB/192KB，HBM 减少 ~15×\n- `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/GPU Memory Hierarchy (HBM vs SRAM).md` (score: 3119.0): 完整数据流 HBM→L2→SMEM→RF→Tensor Core，每级带宽和延迟\n- `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Hardware-Aligned Tile Search (WELDER).md` (score: 2522.1): 三惩罚机制 + MMA fragment 约束（16×16×16 for FP16）\n- `paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/ThunderKittens.../span-idpage-14-0spanB-EXTENDED-RESULTS.md` (score: 1713.1): 默认 16×16 tile，warp-specialized producer-consumer pipeline，跨 H100/4090/M2\n\n### S6: NPU tile 匹配 Cube Unit + Vector Unit（核心机制/NPU）\n- 该链条节点无 note evidence——vault 中缺乏昇腾达芬奇架构或 NPU Cube Unit tile 约束的笔记\n\n### S7: TPU MXU systolic array 128×128/128×256 约束（核心机制/TPU）\n- 该链条节点无 note evidence——vault 中缺乏 TPU MXU tile 适配的笔记\n\n### S8: persistent kernel 中多形状 tile 并发管理（并发交互）\n- `paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/FlashMoE.../1-Introduction.md` (score: 2752.3): persistent kernel 中 OS block（scheduler + subscriber）+ processor blocks 的 tile-level parallelism，tile-driven task scheduling\n- `paper_secs/secs_2026/14-PAT...` (score: 2847.2): resource-efficient multi-tile kernel，prefix-aware 的 shared memory 分区管理\n\n### S9: 动态 tile 切分 — 运行时调整 tile size（动态优化）\n- `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Tile-Based Zero-Tuning Compilation.md` (score: 59.9): 静态分析驱动的 tile/micro-operator 切分，ILP/TLP/arithmetic intensity 多配置\n- `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Multi-Version Micro Kernel Generation.md` (score: 414.7): 同一 operator 的多版本 kernel candidates（不同 register/smem/pipeline stage 组合）\n- `paper_secs/secs_2026/29-Difflow.../4-Compile-Time-Optimizations.md` (score: 1680.2): dEngine 根据输入 property 动态选择、ragged batching 的 tile 编译策略\n\n---\n\n## 方法细节（Kernel 调度粒度）\n\n### 方法1: FlashAttention 的 IO-Aware Tile Size 优化（GPU — Tensor Core/MMA tile 匹配）\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Tiling in GPU Attention Kernel.md` (score: 6335.8)、`knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/GPU Memory Hierarchy (HBM vs SRAM).md` (score: 3119.0)、`knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/FlashAttention（IO-Aware精确注意力融合Kernel）.md` (score: 611.0)\n\n#### Kernel 伪代码：FlashAttention Forward Tile 切分与 SRAM 管理\n\n```cuda\n// ============================================\n// FlashAttention Forward: IO-Aware Tiled Attention\n// Q, K, V: [N, d]  fp16/fp32\n// O: [N, d]       output\n// ============================================\n\n// GPU 硬件参数 (NVIDIA A100/H100)\n#define SMEM_PER_SM     192*1024   // 192 KB shared memory per SM (H100 up to 228KB)\n#define MAX_REGISTERS   65536      // per SM\n#define MAX_THREADS     2048       // per SM (H100)\n#define MAX_WARPS       64         // per SM\n\n// Tile 参数 (根据 SMEM 容量推导)\n// B_r: Q/O tile size along N (rows per Q block)\n// B_c: K/V tile size along N (rows per K/V block)\n// M = SMEM capacity (192KB for A100)\n__device__ void flash_attention_forward(\n    float* Q, float* K, float* V, float* O,\n    int N, int d, int B_r, int B_c\n) {\n    // === Step 0: 分配 Shared Memory ===\n    // 每 block pair (i,j) 的 SRAM 分配 (A100, B_c=384, B_r=64, d=64, fp16):\n    //   K_j tile: B_c × d × 2B  = 384 × 64 × 2 = 49 KB\n    //   V_j tile: B_c × d × 2B  = 384 × 64 × 2 = 49 KB\n    //   Q_i tile: B_r × d × 2B  = 64 × 64 × 2  =  8 KB\n    //   S_ij/P_ij: B_r × B_c × 2B = 64 × 384 × 2 = 49 KB\n    //   Total: 49+49+8+49 = 155 KB ≤ 192KB ✓\n    //\n    // 注: 若 B_c 增大到 512 → Total ≈ 49+49+8+64 = 170KB，仍可放入但降低 occupancy\n    //        若 B_c 减小到 256 → Total ≈ 32+32+8+32 = 104KB，提升 occupancy 但增加 HBM pass 数\n    \n    __shared__ float K_tile[B_c][d];    // [B_c, d] = 384×64 = 24,576 elements\n    __shared__ float V_tile[B_c][d];    // [B_c, d]\n    __shared__ float Q_tile[B_r][d];    // [B_r, d] = 64×64 = 4,096 elements\n    \n    // === Step 1: Outer Loop — 遍历 K/V blocks ===\n    int T_c = ceil(N / B_c);            // N=1024 → T_c=3 KV blocks\n    for (int j = 0; j < T_c; j++) {\n        // Load K_j, V_j from HBM to Shared Memory\n        // Coalesced access: 相邻线程读取连续地址 → 128B transaction alignment\n        cooperative_load(K_tile, K + j*B_c*d, B_c*d);   // 从 HBM 加载\n        cooperative_load(V_tile, V + j*B_c*d, B_c*d);   // 从 HBM 加载\n        __syncthreads();  // 确保 K_j, V_j 全写入 SMEM\n        \n        // === Step 2: Inner Loop — 遍历 Q/O blocks ===\n        int T_r = ceil(N / B_r);        // N=1024 → T_r=16 Q blocks\n        for (int i = 0; i < T_r; i++) {\n            cooperative_load(Q_tile, Q + i*B_r*d, B_r*d);\n            __syncthreads();\n            \n            // === Step 3: Tensor Core MMA — On-chip Compute ===\n            // S = Q × K^T: [B_r,d] × [d,B_c] → [B_r,B_c]\n            // 使用 mma.sync.aligned.m16n8k16 (FP16 Tensor Core)\n            // MMA fragment: 16×16×16 → 每个 warp 产出一个 16×16 fragment\n            #pragma unroll\n            for (int k = 0; k < d; k += 16) {\n                // a_frag: 16×16 from Q_tile\n                // b_frag: 16×16 from K_tile^T\n                // c_frag: accumulate\n                asm volatile(\n                    \"mma.sync.aligned.m16n8k16.row.col.f32.f16.f16.f32\"\n                    : \"+f\"(c_frag[i][j])\n                    : \"r\"(a_frag[i]), \"r\"(b_frag[j])\n                );\n            }\n            \n            // === Step 4: Online Softmax (SRAM only) ===\n            // m_new = max(m_old, row_max(S_ij))\n            // P_ij = exp(S_ij - m_new)\n            // l_new = exp(m_old - m_new) * l_old + row_sum(P_ij)\n            // O_i = diag(exp(m_old - m_new)) * O_i + P_ij @ V_j\n            // 全程在 registers + shared memory 中完成，不写 HBM\n            \n            online_softmax_rescale(S_ij, O_i, m_i, l_i);\n            __syncthreads();\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n// === Tile Size 推导公式 ===\n// B_c = ceil(M / (4 * d))          M=SMEM size, d=head dim\n// B_r = min(B_c, d)\n// A100, d=64, M=192KB → B_c = ceil(192*1024/(4*64*2)) = ceil(49152/512) = 384\n//                      B_r = min(384, 64) = 64\n// H100, d=128, M=228KB → B_c = ceil(228*1024/(4*128*2)) ≈ 228\n//                        B_r = min(228, 128) = 128\n```\n\n#### 指令 Pipeline 时序图\n\n```\nT0    T1    T2    T3    T4    T5    T6    T7    T8    T9    T10   T11\n|-----|-----|-----|-----|-----|-----|-----|-----|-----|-----|-----|-----|\n[Load K_0]   [Load V_0]   [sync]  [Q_0@K_0 MMA]  [softmax]  [P@V MMA]\n           [Load K_1]   [Load V_1]   [sync]  [Q_0@K_1 MMA]  [softmax]  [P@V MMA]\n                      [Load K_2]   [Load V_2]   [sync]  [Q_0@K_2 MMA]...\n  ←────────────────── Global Memory Load ──────────────────→\n                          ←─── Tensor Core MMA (compute) ───→\n                                         ←─── Shared Memory R/W ───→\n\n图例:\n- Load K_j, V_j: HBM → Shared Memory (async copy / TMA on Hopper)\n- Q_i@K_j MMA: Tensor Core warp-level matrix multiply (warpgroup::mma)\n- softmax: register-level row reduction + exp + rescale\n- P@V MMA: second Tensor Core MMA for output accumulation\n\n异步重叠 (Hopper TMA):\nT0    T1    T2    T3    T4    T5\n|-----|-----|-----|-----|-----|\n[TMA Load K_0,V_0] [Compute S_ij] [TMA Load K_1,V_1] [Compute S_ij+1]...\n                    ↑ Producer warp       ↑ Consumer warp\n                    ↑ Warp-specialized pipeline (FA3)\n```\n\n#### 注解\n\n**Tile Size 与 SM 资源匹配**:\n- **Shared Memory 约束**: 192KB/SM (A100)、228KB/SM (H100) 是可配置 SMEM/L1 的统一 SRAM。tile 总 size 必须 ≤ SMEM/SM。H100 支持 `cudaFuncSetAttribute` 配置 SMEM 上限到 228KB\n- **Register 约束**: 每 SM 65536×32-bit regs = 256KB。每 thread 最多 255 regs (A100)、每 warp 32 threads → 若每 thread 使用 128 regs，则每 SM 最多 65536/128/32 = 16 warps → occupancy=25%\n- **Occupancy 影响**: 更大 tile → 更大 SMEM/thread → 更少 resident warps → 更低 occupancy → 延迟隐藏能力下降。FlashAttention 中 B_c 从 64→256 增大会降低 occupancy，但 HBM passes 减少带来的收益更大（笔记 Figure 2 middle 消融实验验证）\n- **Bank Conflict 避免**: K_tile 和 V_tile 行对齐到 128B（32 floats），`cooperative_load` 保证连续访问。shared memory 32 banks × 4B/bank，128B 对齐后无 bank conflict\n\n**Tensor Core MMA Tile 约束**:\n- FP16 MMA: `mma.sync.m16n8k16` → M=16, N=8, K=16，每 warp 每步计算 16×8 output subtile\n- B_r=64, B_c=384 → B_r 必须能被 16 整除（64=4×16 ✓），B_c 必须能被 8 整除（384=48×8 ✓）\n- MMA tile shape 优化：若 B_c 不能被 8 整除 → 最后一个 fragment 需要 padding → 浪费计算；若 B_r 不能被 16 整除 → 部分 warp 空闲 → 降低利用率\n\n**HBM 访问量分析**（笔记数据，N=1024, d=64, B_r=64, B_c=384）:\n- Q 加载: N×d = 128KB (16次，每次 8KB)\n- K 加载: T_c × B_c × d = 3 × 384 × 64 × 2B = 144KB\n- V 加载: 同 K = 144KB\n- O 写入: 128KB\n- **Total forward HBM ≈ 552KB** vs 标准 attention ≈ 8.5MB → **~15× reduction**\n\n---\n\n### 方法2: FlashMoE 的 Persistent Kernel Tile-Level 并发（MoE GEMM tile + 多算子/微算子并发）\n\n**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/FlashMoE.../1-Introduction.md` (score: 2752.3)、`knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/PIT (Permutation Invariant Transformation) for MoE.md` (score: 47.2)\n\n#### Kernel 伪代码：Persistent Kernel 中 Multi-Tile 并发管理\n\n```cuda\n// ============================================\n// FlashMoE: Single Persistent Kernel = Gate + Dispatch + Expert FFN + Combine\n// 完全融合在一个 persistent kernel 中\n// ============================================\n\n// 硬件平台: NVIDIA H100 (132 SMs, 228KB SMEM/SM)\n// Grid: N thread blocks, 其中 N-1 个 processor blocks + 1 OS block\n// 每个 block: 128 threads (4 warps), 控制 register 使用避免 spill\n\n// === Tile 维度选择 ===\n// FlashMoE 经过参数 sweep 选择 tile = (128, 64)\n// 即: M=128 (token batch in tile), K=64 (hidden dim in tile)\n// 理由:\n//   - 增大 tile width (K 维度) → 显著增加 register 压力 → register spill to local memory\n//   - 增大 tile height (M 维度) 不增加 threads → 每 thread 工作量增大 → 延迟增加\n//   - 增大 threads/block → 减少 concurrent blocks → 降低 SM occupancy\n//   - threads/block > 128 → __syncthreads() barrier overhead 增加\n\n#define TILE_M     128    // token batch (rows of input matrix)\n#define TILE_K     64     // hidden dimension (columns)\n#define TILE_FFN   2048   // FFN intermediate dim (expert weight col dim)\n#define MAX_TASKS   256   // 最大 pending tasks in scheduler queue\n\n// === Actor 模型: 3 种 warp-specialized 角色 ===\n// 1. Processor (N-1 blocks × 4 warps): 执行 GEMM (CUTLASS) + element-wise\n// 2. Scheduler (1 warp in OS block): 多线程 work-conserving 任务调度\n// 3. Subscriber (3 warps in OS block): 解码远程 tile packets → 任务入队\n\n__global__ void flash_moe_persistent_kernel(\n    float* input_tokens,       // [S, H]  S=seq_len, H=hidden_dim\n    float* expert_weights,     // [E, H, D]  experts, intermediate dim\n    float* output_tokens,      // [S, H]\n    int S, int H, int E, int D, int tile_M, int tile_K\n) {\n    // === 初始化: 确定 actor 角色 ===\n    int block_id = blockIdx.x;\n    int warp_id  = threadIdx.x / 32;\n    \n    if (block_id < gridDim.x - 1) {\n        // ====== Processor Actor ======\n        // 使用 CUTLASS 底层 GEMM 基础设施\n        // CUTLASS tile configuration: \n        //   ThreadBlockShape: 128×128×32\n        //   WarpShape: 64×64×32\n        //   MMA: 16×8×16 (FP16 Tensor Core)\n        \n        __shared__ float A_tile[tile_M][tile_K];    // input tile\n        __shared__ float B_tile[tile_K][tile_FFN];  // expert weight tile\n        __shared__ float C_tile[tile_M][tile_FFN];   // intermediate result\n        float accum_reg[8][8];  // register accumulator (MMA fragment)\n        \n        while (true) {\n            // === 从 Scheduler 获取 task ===\n            TaskDescriptor task = fetch_task_from_scheduler();  // 通过 global memory\n            if (task.type == TASK_TERMINATE) break;\n            \n            // === Task 1: Gate + Routing (element-wise) ===\n            if (task.op == OP_GATE) {\n                // Gate 计算: Softmax(W_g · x)  → 选择 top-k experts\n                // Tile: 128 tokens × 64 hidden\n                float gate_scores[tile_M][E];\n                // ... 线性变换 + softmax + top-k selection\n                // 结果写入 symmetric tensor layout L (for inter-GPU dispatch)\n            }\n            \n            // === Task 2: Expert FFN (GEMM-based) ===\n            if (task.op == OP_GEMM0) {\n                // A_tile: [128, 64] input activation tile\n                // B_tile: [64, 2048] expert weight W1 tile\n                // C_tile: [128, 2048] output\n                \n                // CUTLASS warp-level MMA:\n                // warpgroup::mma(A_tile, B_tile, C_tile)\n                // 利用 Tensor Core mma.m16n8k16 × 多次迭代\n                for (int k_tile = 0; k_tile < H/16; k_tile++) {\n                    load_to_reg(A_reg, A_tile + k_tile*16);\n                    load_to_reg(B_reg, B_tile + k_tile*16);\n                    mma_sync(C_reg, A_reg, B_reg, C_reg);  // 累加\n                }\n                // Activation: GELU(C_tile) → 在寄存器中完成\n                // 避免单独 kernel launch → 消除 kernel launch overhead\n                apply_gelu_in_registers(C_reg);\n            }\n            \n            // === Task 3: GEMM1 (FFN second linear) ===\n            if (task.op == OP_GEMM1) {\n                // C_tile: [128, 2048] (post-GELU)\n                // W2_tile: [2048, 64]\n                // Output: [128, 64]\n                // 同理 CUTLASS warp-level MMA\n            }\n            \n            // === Task 4: Expert Combine (Hadamard product + reduction) ===\n            if (task.op == OP_COMBINE) {\n                // weighted_sum = Σ g_i * expert_output_i\n                // 在寄存器中完成 element-wise 加权累加\n            }\n            \n            // === Inter-GPU Communication (via NVSHMEM DMA) ===\n            if (task.op == OP_SEND_TILE) {\n                // payload-efficient: 不发送 padding tokens\n                // 直接 DMA 写入 remote GPU symmetric tensor buffer\n                nvshmem_put_nbi(remote_buffer, local_tile, tile_size, remote_pe);\n            }\n        }\n        \n        // ====== Scheduler Actor (OS block, warp 0) ======\n        // work-conserving: 只要有 processor idle + task ready → 立即调度\n        // task queue: 在 global memory 中, 支持 multi-threaded enqueue/dequeue\n        // 调度策略:\n        //   1. 优先调度同一 expert 的连续 tile (提升 cache 局部性)\n        //   2. GEMM0→GEMM1 的 data dependency 通过 notification signal 传递\n        //   3. 跨 GPU tile 通过 subscriber 解码后入队\n        \n        // ====== Subscriber Actor (OS block, warps 1-3) ======\n        // 监控 remote GPU incoming DMA buffer\n        // 解码 tile packets → 创建 task descriptors → notify scheduler\n    }\n}\n```\n\n#### 指令 Pipeline 时序图：Persistent Kernel 中 Compute-Communication Overlap\n\n```\n时间 ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────>\n\nProcessor Block 0 [GEMM0: E0-Tile0] [GELU] [GEMM1: E0-T0] [COMBINE] ░░[GEMM0: E3-T1]...\nProcessor Block 1 [GEMM0: E1-Tile0] [GELU] [GEMM1: E1-T0] [COMBINE] [GEMM0: E0-T2]...\nProcessor Block 2 [GEMM0: E2-Tile0] [GELU] [GEMM1: E2-T0] [SEND→GPU1] [GEMM0: E1-T2]...\nProcessor Block 3 ░░░░░░░░░░░░[SEND→GPU0]░░░░░░░░░░░░[RECV←GPU1][GEMM0:E4-T0]...\nOS Block Scheduler  [Enqueue T0] [Enqueue T1] [Dequeue T2] [Notify SUB]...\nOS Block Subscriber ░░[Decode remote packet]░░ [Notify SCHED] ░░[Decode]░░...\n\nGPU-Peer DMA ────────[PUT E2-Tile0 → GPU1]──────[GET E4-Tile0 ← GPU1]───────\n\n图例:\n- ░░ = idle/waiting\n- GEMM0 = first linear (W1), GEMM1 = second linear (W2)\n- E0-T0 = Expert 0 Tile 0, 被 scheduler 动态分配到空闲 processor\n- SEND/GET = inter-GPU tile transfer via NVSHMEM one-sided DMA\n- 注: FlashMoE tile(128,64) 确保 128 threads/block → 充足的 occupancy\n       不增大 thread count 以免 __syncthreads() 开销增加\n```\n\n#### 注解\n\n**Persistent Kernel Multi-Tile 管理策略**:\n- **Tile-level parallelism**: 输入 token 矩阵沿 sequence 维度切分为 tile(128,64)，每个 tile 由 processor block 独立处理\n- **OS Block 资源占用**: 1/132 blocks (H100) → ~0.75% SM 资源用于调度管理，其余用于计算\n- **Single kernel launch vs 550 kernel launches**: FlashMoE 1 次 launch 替代 Megatron-LM+DeepEP 的 432-550 次 launch → 消除 host-device 同步点、kernel 启动间隙 → SM 利用率从 14% 提升到 93.17%（笔记 Table 1, Figure 4a, 9）\n- **Task queue in global memory**: 调度开销 ≥ SMEM-based inter-actor communication (OS block 内部 subscriber↔scheduler 通过 SMEM)\n\n**MoE Tile 特殊考虑**:\n- Expert 分散访存: 不同 expert 的输入 token 经过 routing 后可能分散在不同 GPU → tile 需要通过 DMA/RDMA 传输\n- PIT (笔记 `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/PIT (Permutation Invariant Transformation) for MoE.md`): 将稀疏 micro-tile 重组为 dense tile → 高 GPU GEMM 利用率 → 置换不变性保证计算等价\n- Expert capacity padding: FlashMoE 使用 in-place padding（不发送空 token），减少通信开销\n\n---\n\n### 方法3: CUTLASS Kernel Tile 配置与 MMA Tile 利用率优化\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Hardware-Aligned Tile Search (WELDER).md` (score: 2522.1)、`paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/ThunderKittens.../span-idpage-14-0spanB-EXTENDED-RESULTS.md` (score: 1713.1)\n\n#### Kernel 伪代码：CUTLASS-Style Grouped GEMM Tile 配置\n\n```cuda\n// ============================================\n// CUTLASS v3 Grouped GEMM for MoE Expert FFN\n// Tile配置驱动的warp-level MMA调度\n// ============================================\n\n// === CUTLASS Tile 配置层次 ===\n// Level 1: ThreadBlock Tile (shared memory resident)\n//   ThreadBlockShape: 128×128×32  (M×N×K)\n// Level 2: Warp Tile (register resident)  \n//   WarpShape: 64×64×32\n// Level 3: MMA Instruction Tile (1 cycle)\n//   InstructionShape: 16×8×16 (FP16)、16×8×32 (INT8)、16×16×32 (FP8 on Hopper)\n\ntemplate <\n    typename ElementA,       // input activation, fp16\n    typename ElementB,       // expert weight, fp16  \n    typename ElementC,       // output, fp32\n    int TileM, int TileN, int TileK,  // ThreadBlock tile shape\n    int WarpM, int WarpN, int WarpK,  // Warp tile shape\n    int Stages                           // Software pipeline stages (3 for H100)\n>\nstruct MoEExpertGEMM {\n    // === Shared Memory 分区 (H100: 228KB/SM, 可配置) ===\n    // 双缓冲 (double-buffered) shared memory for software pipeline:\n    //   A_smem: Stages × TileM × TileK × sizeof(fp16)\n    //           = 3 × 128 × 32 × 2 = 24,576 B ≈ 24 KB\n    //   B_smem: Stages × TileK × TileN × sizeof(fp16)\n    //           = 3 × 32 × 128 × 2 = 24,576 B ≈ 24 KB\n    // Total SMEM ≈ 48 KB → 剩余 228-48=180 KB 用于 occupancy\n    \n    // === Register 分配 (每 warp) ===\n    // 每 warp 计算 64×64 output subtile → 4×4 MMA iterations\n    // A_frag: 64×32 fp16 = 2048 elements × 2B / 32 threads = 128B/thread = 32 regs\n    // B_frag: 32×64 fp16 = 2048 elements × 2B / 32 threads = 32 regs  \n    // C_accum: 64×64 fp32 = 4096 elements × 4B / 32 threads = 128 regs\n    // Total ≈ 192 regs/thread → 255 max, OK for H100\n    \n    __device__ void operator()(\n        float* C, const float* A, const float* B, int M, int N, int K\n    ) {\n        // === 确定 MMA tile 对齐 ===\n        // FP16 MMA: M 必须被 16 整除, N 必须被 8 整除, K 必须被 16 整除\n        // 若实际维度不对齐 → padding to next multiple → 计算后 crop\n        \n        // === TMA (Tensor Memory Accelerator) — H100 only ===\n        // 异步 HBM→SMEM 数据搬运，不占用 register/shared memory 带宽\n        #if __CUDA_ARCH__ >= 900  // SM90 (Hopper)\n            // TMA descriptor for A matrix tile\n            // TMA load: 1D array, coordinate-based addressing\n            // 每个 thread block 1 个 TMA unit → producer warp 负责\n            if (warp_id == PRODUCER_WARP) {\n                for (int stage = 0; stage < Stages; stage++) {\n                    // expect TMA completion before loading next tile\n                    cp_async_bulk_tensor::expect_read(barrier);\n                    // 异步加载 A tile to SMEM\n                    cp_async_bulk_tensor::load_global_to_shared(\n                        A_smem[stage], A_ptr, tile_coord, barrier\n                    );\n                    // 异步加载 B tile to SMEM\n                    cp_async_bulk_tensor::load_global_to_shared(\n                        B_smem[stage], B_ptr, tile_coord, barrier\n                    );\n                }\n            }\n        #else\n            // 传统 async copy (cp.async) for A100/4090\n            // 128B transaction width for coalesced access\n            cp_async::load_global_to_shared(A_smem[stage], A_ptr, tile_size);\n            cp_async::commit();\n        #endif\n        \n        // === Warp-level MMA (consumer warps) ===\n        // 每个 warp 计算自己的 output subtile\n        // CUTLASS warp tile iterator 自动处理分块\n        #pragma unroll\n        for (int k_block = 0; k_block < K; k_block += TileK) {\n            // SMEM → Register (copy fragment)\n            load_A_fragment(A_reg, A_smem[current_stage]);\n            load_B_fragment(B_reg, B_smem[current_stage]);\n            \n            // Tensor Core MMA: A_frag[16,16] × B_frag[16,8] → C_accum[16,8]\n            // 对于 WarpM=64, WarpN=64:\n            //   warp_tile_iters_M = 64/16 = 4\n            //   warp_tile_iters_N = 64/8  = 8\n            //   Total MMA instructions per warp per k_block = 4×8 = 32\n            #pragma unroll\n            for (int m = 0; m < WarpM/16; m++) {\n                #pragma unroll\n                for (int n = 0; n < WarpN/8; n++) {\n                    mma_sync(C_accum[m][n], A_reg[m], B_reg[n], C_accum[m][n]);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        \n        // === Epilogue: Activation + Store ===\n        // 融合 GELU activation → 在寄存器中完成，避免额外 kernel\n        #pragma unroll\n        for (int m = 0; m < WarpM/16; m++) {\n            #pragma unroll\n            for (int n = 0; n < WarpN/8; n++) {\n                // GELU: x * Φ(x) 其中 Φ 是 standard Gaussian CDF\n                // 近似: 0.5x * (1 + tanh(√(2/π) * (x + 0.044715 * x^3)))\n                apply_gelu_fused_in_reg(C_accum[m][n]);\n            }\n        }\n        // Store to global memory (coalesced, 128B-aligned)\n        store_coalesced(C_ptr, C_accum);\n    }\n};\n\n// === Tile Shape 对 MMA 利用率的影响分析 ===\n// 场景 1: 完美对齐 (TileM=128, TileN=128, TileK=32)\n//   128/16=8 M-iterations × 128/8=16 N-iterations = 128 MMA/warp\n//   → 100% Tensor Core 利用率（无 padding waste）\n//\n// 场景 2: 非对齐 (TileM=130, TileN=128, TileK=32)  \n//   130→padded to 144 (=9×16) → 144/16=9 M-iterations\n//   实际有效计算: 130×128, Padding: 14×128\n//   → 利用率 = 130/144 = 90.3%（10% waste）\n//\n// 场景 3: 小 tile (TileM=64, TileN=64, TileK=16)\n//   64/16=4 × 64/8=8 = 32 MMA/warp\n//   → 低 MMA 指令密度 → warp scheduler 有更多 stall slots → 低 SM 利用率\n//   但高 occupancy（更多 resident warps 延迟隐藏）\n```\n\n#### 注解\n\n**CUTLASS Tile 配置层次约束**:\n- **ThreadBlock Shape 约束**: TileM 必须是 WarpM 的整数倍，TileN 必须是 WarpN 的整数倍。CUTLASS v3 推荐 128×128×32 为 MoE expert FFN 的默认配置\n- **MMA Fragment 对齐**: FP16 `mma.m16n8k16` → M 维被 16 整除、N 维被 8 整除、K 维被 16 整除。不满足时需 padding → 计算浪费。FP8 (Hopper) `mma.m16n8k32` → K 维对齐放宽到 32\n- **Bank Conflict 避免**: CUTLASS 自动 padded shared memory layout (swizzle mode) → 确保同一 warp 内所有 lane 访问不同 bank。例如 A[128,32] 经 swizzle 后每行跨 32 banks 均匀分布\n- **WELDER Hardware-Aligned Tile Search**: 笔记显示三个惩罚——coalesced access penalty (非连续 128B transaction)、parallelism penalty (tile 数 < 128)、capacity penalty (footprint > capacity) ——确保搜索到的 tile 配置不仅在 traffic cost 上最优，而且在硬件执行效率上最优\n\n**ThunderKittens 的简化 Tile 抽象**（笔记 `paper_secs/secs_multimodal_kernel/ThunderKittens...`）:\n- 默认 16×16 tile for Tensor Core，支持 padded tiles 处理非对齐维度\n- LCSF 模板 (Load-Compute-Store-Finish): producer warp 通过 TMA 异步加载 → consumer warpgroups 执行 MMA → store warp 写回\n- Pipeline stages: 对于 128×256 (2 compute warpgroups) 或 192×192 (3 compute warpgroups) output tile，自动生成 4-stage software pipeline\n- 跨平台: NVIDIA H100 (CUDA)、NVIDIA 4090 (Ada Lovelace)、Apple M2 (Metal) 共用同一抽象\n\n---\n\n### 方法4: 编译器驱动的 Tile 自动切分与动态选择（编译时 + 运行时）\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Tile-Based Zero-Tuning Compilation.md` (score: 59.9)、`knowledge_notes/编译知识笔记/Multi-Version Micro Kernel Generation.md` (score: 414.7)、`paper_secs/secs_2026/29-Difflow.../4-Compile-Time-Optimizations.md` (score: 1680.2)\n\n#### 编译时 Tile 多版本生成策略\n\n```\n// ============================================\n// Infera Compiler: Tile-Based Zero-Tuning Compilation\n// 编译时静态分析 → 多配置 micro-kernel 生成 → 无需 GPU profiling\n// ============================================\n\n编译流程:\n  DNN Operator (e.g., MoE Expert FFN, DiT Attention)\n        │\n        ▼\n  [1] Operator Tiling: 将 operator 切为 tile/micro-operators\n        │  tile shape 枚举 (从最小合法 shape 开始扩展)\n        │  对每个 axis: expand_toward_hardware_alignment\n        │\n        ▼\n  [2] Multi-Version Generation: 对每个 micro-operator 生成多份 kernel\n        │  配置维度:\n        │    - Register cap: 64 / 96 / 128 registers per thread\n        │    - SMEM cap: 48 / 80 / 112 / 144 KiB\n        │    - Pipeline stages: 2 / 3 / 4\n        │    - Spatial tile: (M=128,N=64) vs (M=64,N=128) vs (M=256,N=32)...\n        │    - Reduction tile: K=16 vs K=32 vs K=64\n        │\n        ▼\n  [3] Static Analysis (Zero-Tuning, 无需 GPU profiling):\n        │  - Resource constraint check: reg ≤ reg_cap, SMEM ≤ SMEM_cap\n        │  - Instruction scheduling: ILP 分析 → 独立指令数 → dual-issue opportunity\n        │  - Arithmetic intensity: FLOPs/Byte → compute-bound vs memory-bound\n        │  - Warp specialization: producer/consumer split on H100\n        │\n        ▼\n  [4] Kernel Selection at Runtime:\n        根据输入 shape 和硬件平台选择最佳 kernel variant\n        若输入变化 (如 MoE token count、DiT latent size) → 选择对应 variant\n\n// === 多版本 kernel 示例 ===\n// 同一 DiT Attention 算子，根据 sequence length 选择不同 tile 配置：\n\nkernel_variants = {\n    // Variant A: 短序列 (N ≤ 512), 大 tile, 高 arithmetic intensity\n    \"short_seq\": {\n        B_r: 128, B_c: 256,       // large tiles, fewer HBM rounds\n        reg_cap: 128,              // high register usage\n        smem_cap: 144,             // 144 KiB SMEM\n        pipeline_stages: 2,\n        target: \"compute-bound\"    // compute dominates\n    },\n    // Variant B: 长序列 (N > 512), 小 tile, 高 occupancy\n    \"long_seq\": {\n        B_r: 64, B_c: 128,        // small tiles, more resident blocks\n        reg_cap: 64,               // low register usage → high occupancy\n        smem_cap: 80,              // 80 KiB SMEM\n        pipeline_stages: 4,\n        target: \"memory-bound\"     // memory bandwidth is bottleneck\n    },\n    // Variant C: FP8 Hopper variant\n    \"fp8_h100\": {\n        B_r: 128, B_c: 256,\n        mma: \"m16n8k32\",          // FP8 uses larger K dimension in MMA\n        use_tma: true,             // TMA for async data movement\n        pipeline_stages: 4,        // deeper pipeline for FP8\n    }\n};\n```\n\n#### Dynamic dEngine Selection in ChituDiffusion (DiT)\n\n```\n// ============================================\n// ChituDiffusion 运行时 Tile/DEngine 动态选择\n// 笔记: paper_secs/secs_2026/29-Difflow...\n// ============================================\n\n运行时决策流程:\n  Request arrives (e.g., DiT image gen, ragged input shape)\n        │\n        ▼\n  [1] Data Property Inference\n      - 用 fingerprint hash 检测输入 redundancy\n      - 评估 property condition expression\n        │\n        ▼\n  [2] dEngine Selection (Algorithm 1 in paper)\n      - 枚举匹配 property condition 的 dEngine\n      - 每个 dEngine = 预编译的 tile 配置 + kernel variant\n      - 选择 max batch size within hardware constraints\n        │\n        ▼\n  [3] Tile-Level Execution\n      - Ragged operation regularization: 不规则 operation → 等价 regular operator\n      - Round-robin tile → thread block mapping (for ragged batching)\n        │\n        ▼\n  [4] Performance Model 辅助选择\n      - OLS regression on input size → estimated execution time\n      - compute-intensive ops: linear/quadratic scaling with input\n      - selects dEngine with minimal estimated latency\n```\n\n#### 注解\n\n**编译时 vs 运行时 Tile 选择权衡**:\n- **Zero-Tuning (Infera)**: 编译时全静态分析 → 无需 GPU profiling → 比 Ansor/MetaSchedule 快 2-3 个数量级。适合已知硬件配置的场景\n- **dEngine Selection (ChituDiffusion)**: 编译时生成多个 dEngine → 运行时根据 data property 动态选择。适合 diffusion 模型的不同 denoising step、不同 batch size、不同 LoRA/ControlNet 配置\n- **Triton Autotuning**: 笔记未详细说明，但一般流程是: 定义 tile size 为 tunable parameter → 编译时网格搜索 → 缓存最优配置。对 MoE 的 token 分配可变性支持有限\n\n**动态 Tile 切分的可行性分析**（笔记证据综述）:\n- **MoE expert 输入 token 数变化**: FlashMoE 使用固定 tile(128,64)，scheduler 动态分配 task → 自适应不同 expert 的 token 数；PIT 方法在运行时重组微 tile\n- **DiT 不同 diffusion step 的 latent size**: ChituDiffusion 通过对不同输入 property 预编译多个 dEngine 来支持；编译时已知所有可能 shape → 运行时快速 match\n- **笔记未明确说明**: runtime real-time tile shape adjustment（如在 kernel 中动态改变 shared memory tile 维度）的可行性。笔记更多指向编译时多版本 + 运行时选择的策略\n\n---\n\n## 方法对比表\n\n| 方法 | 核心机制 | Tile 配置 | 实现框架 | 硬件平台 | 关键指标 | 笔记证据 |\n|------|----------|----------|----------|----------|----------|----------|\n| FlashAttention IO-Aware Tiling | online softmax rescaling + HBM→SRAM tiling | B_r=64, B_c=384 (A100,d=64); B_r=128, B_c≈228 (H100,d=128) | CUDA C++ / Triton / PyTorch 2.0+ native | A100/H100 (NVIDIA) | HBM 访问减少 ~15×, 2-4× speedup | `Tiling in GPU Attention Kernel.md` (6335.8), `FlashAttention.md` (611.0) |\n| FlashMoE Persistent Kernel | single persistent kernel + actor model + CUTLASS GEMM | tile=(128,64), 128 threads/block, CUTLASS 128×128×32 | CUDA C++ / CUTLASS / NVSHMEM | H100 / A100 (NVIDIA), multi-GPU NVLink | 93.17% SM util (vs 14% Megatron), 6× latency speedup | `FlashMoE.../1-Introduction.md` (2752.3), `PIT for MoE.md` (47.2) |\n| CUTLASS v3 Grouped GEMM | warp-specialized double-buffering + TMA async copy + MMA abstraction | ThreadBlock 128×128×32, Warp 64×64×32, MMA 16×8×16 (FP16) | CUTLASS v3 C++ template library | H100 (Hopper), A100 (Ampere) | FP8 support, 3-4 stage pipeline, swizzle SMEM layout | `WELDER.md` (2522.1, hardware penalty), `ThunderKittens.md` (1713.1, tile abstraction) |\n| ThunderKittens | LCSF template + 16×16 padded tiles + warpgroup MMA | default 16×16; 128×256 (2 wg) or 192×192 (3 wg) output tile | TK C++ library (<1MB) | H100, 4090, Apple M2 (cross-platform) | ≤200 LoC per kernel, 0.87-14.5× vs baselines | `ThunderKittens.../span-idpage-14-0spanB-EXTENDED-RESULTS.md` (1713.1) |\n| Infera Tile-Based Zero-Tuning | static-analysis multi-version micro-kernel generation | per-micro-op: reg(64/96/128), smem(48/80/112/144 KiB), pipeline(2/3/4) | Infera Compiler | GPU (V100/A100) | 2-3 orders of magnitude faster compile than search-based | `Tile-Based Zero-Tuning.md` (59.9), `Multi-Version Micro Kernel.md` (414.7) |\n| ChituDiffusion dEngine | data-property-aware dGraph decomposition + ragged regularization | tile-based dEngine per input property | Python/C++ / Triton / FlashAttention | A100/H100 (NVIDIA) | 1.58× avg throughput, 2.2× for correlative requests (H100) | `Difflow.../4-Compile-Time-Optimizations.md` (1680.2) |\n| WELDER Hardware-Aligned Tile Search | MemTraffic + 3 hardware penalty (coalesced/parallelism/capacity) | MMA fragment alignment: 16×16×16 (FP16), ≥128 parallelism | WELDER Compiler | V100/A100 (NVIDIA) | hardware-aligned tile shape → optimal execution | `WELDER.md` (2522.1) |\n| PIT for MoE | sparse micro-tiles → dense tile (permutation invariance) | micro-tile size configurable → dense tile for GEMM | Graph-level compiler pass | GPU (通用) | 高 GPU GEMM 利用率 (dense tile) | `PIT for MoE.md` (47.2) |\n\n---\n\n## Tile Size 优化的硬件体系结构约束总览\n\n| 硬件平台 | 计算单元 | Tile 形状约束 | SMEM/片上 Buffer | Register 约束 | 关键优化策略 |\n|----------|----------|---------------|------------------|---------------|-------------|\n| **NVIDIA H100 (Hopper)** | Tensor Core (FP8/FP16/BF16) | MMA 16×8×16 (FP16), 16×8×32 (FP8); WGMMA 异步指令 | 228 KB/SM (可配置 SMEM/L1 split) | 65536×32-bit/SM, 255/thread max | TMA async copy + warp-specialized producer-consumer pipeline + 4-stage SW pipeline |\n| **NVIDIA A100 (Ampere)** | Tensor Core 3rd gen | MMA 16×8×16 (FP16), 16×8×8 (TF32) | 192 KB/SM (max 164 KB SMEM) | 同 H100 | cp.async + double-buffered SMEM + tile B_r/B_c 按 SMEM/sqrt(d) 推导 |\n| **NVIDIA 4090 (Ada)** | Tensor Core 4th gen | 同 A100 MMA 尺寸 | 128 KB/SM (max 100 KB SMEM) | 65536/SM | ThunderKittens padded tiles 支持非对齐维度 |\n| **华为昇腾 910B (NPU)** | Cube Unit (脉动阵列) + Vector Unit + Scalar Unit | 笔记未明确说明 | L0/L1 buffer (笔记未给出精确大小) | 笔记未明确说明 | 笔记未提供 vault evidence — 需补充昇腾 Da Vinci 架构的 tile 约束资料 |\n| **Google TPU v5e/v5p** | MXU (Systolic Array) | 128×128 或 128×256 MXU | VPU memory (笔记未给出精确大小) | N/A (非 SIMT) | 笔记未提供 vault evidence — 需补充 TPU XLA 的 tile shape 约束资料 |\n| **AMD MI300X (CDNA3)** | Matrix Core | 笔记未明确说明 | 笔记未明确说明 | 笔记未明确说明 | 笔记未提供 vault evidence — 需补充 ROCm/HIP kernel tile 资料 |\n| **Groq LPU** | Tensor Streaming Processor | 笔记未明确说明 | 笔记未明确说明 | 确定性的 SRAM-only 架构 | 笔记未提供 vault evidence |\n| **Apple M2 (ANE+GPU)** | Apple GPU + Neural Engine | 16×16 tile (Metal, 笔记证据) | 统一内存架构 | 笔记未给出精确数字 | ThunderKittens 跨平台移植到 Metal |\n\n> 注：NPU/TPU/AMD/Groq 平台的详细 tile 约束在本 vault 中缺乏笔记证据。以下基于已知公开信息的补充分析标注为「Web 推断」。\n\n### Web 推断补充：NPU 和 TPU 的 Tile 约束\n\n**升腾 910B (Da Vinci 架构)** (Web 推断):\n- Cube Unit (矩阵乘): 16×16×16 FP16 MAC per cycle，类似 Tensor Core 的 MMA fragment 概念。tile 的 M、N 维度应被 16 整除\n- Vector Unit (向量计算): 256-bit SIMD width → FP16 下 16 elements/cycle。tile 的 element-wise activation/normalization 应匹配 16-element 向量宽度\n- L0 Buffer (A/B): 各 64KB → tile footprint 主导的约束类似 GPU SMEM。推测 tile size ≤ ceil(Cube_L0 / element_size / data_width)\n\n**TPU v5e/v5p** (Web 推断):\n- MXU 128×128 (BF16/INT8)，v5p 支持 128×256。这是 systolic array 的硬件固定尺寸\n- Tile 必须适配 MXU 维度：矩阵乘的 M 和 N 维度应被 128 整除或使用 padding；若 tile < 128，MXU 部分 PEs 空闲 → 硬件利用率下降\n- VPU memory: 每 TPU chip 16-32 GB HBM，但 on-chip memory 受限于 MXU 输入 buffer → tile 选择需在 systolic array 输入带宽和 HBM 带宽间权衡\n\n---\n\n## 不确定性\n\n1. **NPU/TPU vault 证据缺失**: 本 vault 中缺乏 昇腾/Cube Unit/Vector Unit 和 TPU/MXU 的笔记。S6/S7 链条节点的回答基于公开知识的 Web 推断，非 vault 笔记证据\n2. **Video kernel tile 证据有限**: vault 中未发现专门讨论 video spatial-temporal attention、3D convolution 或 optical flow 的 tile shape 优化的笔记。S4 答案基于 Difflow 的 video diffusion 通用优化推断\n3. **多模态 fusion tile 证据有限**: vault 中未发现专门讨论 cross-attention + modality fusion 在 kernel 层面的 tile 并发管理的笔记。S3 答案基于 Flex Attention 的通用 attention abstraction 和 FlashMoE 的 multi-tile 管理推断\n4. **动态 tile 运行时调整**: 笔记显示的是编译时多版本 + 运行时选择的策略（而非 kernel 内实时改变 shared memory tile 维度）。kernel 执行中动态改变 tile size 的可行性（如通过动态 shared memory `extern __shared__`）在笔记中未明确探讨\n5. **AMD MI300X / Groq LPU**: vault 中没有任何这些平台的笔记证据\n6. **FlashAttention-3 的 warp-specialized 双流水线**: 笔记简要提及但未展开具体的 tile 分配细节和 producer/consumer synchronization 实现\n\n---\n\n[ANSWER_AGENT_DONE] Q4.4\n"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":102312,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":28032,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null